    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Past Memos&quot; is a story-driven detective game set in the foggy atmosphere of the 90s. You play as a former detective who was dismissed from the force due to false accusations; your goal is to clear your name and solve dark cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in three different neighborhoods inspired by the streets of 90s New York. Each area offers different experiences with its unique social structure and job opportunities. In this world filled with mini-games, you gather clues, earn a living through in-game tasks, and uncover the secrets of the past.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Past Memos&quot; is a story-driven detective game set in the foggy atmosphere of the 90s. You play as a former detective who was dismissed from the force due to false accusations; your goal is to clear your name and solve dark cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in three different neighborhoods inspired by the streets of 90s New York. Each area offers different experiences with its unique social structure and job opportunities. In this world filled with mini-games, you gather clues, earn a living through in-game tasks, and uncover the secrets of the past.</p>",
